{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18068","headline":"答孟郊 · 韩愈","name":"答孟郊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"规模背时利，文字覰天巧。\n人皆余酒肉，子独不得饱。\n才春思已乱，始秋悲又搅。\n朝餐动及午，夜讽恒至卯。\n名声暂羶腥，肠肚镇煎煼。\n古心虽自鞭，世路终难拗。\n弱拒喜张臂，猛拏闲缩爪。\n见倒谁肯扶，从嗔我须齩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}